# Most of `.claude/` is per-user state (settings.local.json,
# ad-hoc skill installs, project memory). We DO want the vendored
# Remotion best-practices skill committed though, so every
# contributor's Claude rail picks it up. Git can't re-include a
# child if its parent directory is excluded, so we exclude
# `.claude/*` (one level) and re-include the skill path piece by
# piece.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/remotion-best-practices/

# Fonts fetched by install.sh (OFL-licensed DejaVu)
templates/fonts/*.ttf
vertex-reader-demo/*
